  "goodToKnow": "Der Lebensunterhalt is one's livelihood or living costs: seinen Lebensunterhalt verdienen (to earn a living), für den Lebensunterhalt sorgen. In immigration law, ein gesicherter Lebensunterhalt (secured means of support) is a key requirement for most residence permits, often proved by a blocked account (Sperrkonto) for students. Der Unterhalt alone also means maintenance payments, for example for children after a divorce. It has no plural."
